## Noise Reduction

`SteamWindowSuppressor` only logs poll diagnostics when the observed Wine process count changes or every 60 seconds (120 ticks × 0.5s). This avoids flooding the log with hundreds of identical `poll#NNNN` lines during idle sessions.

## Important Constraints

- Do NOT use `Logger(subsystem:category:)` directly in new code — always use `MeridianLog(category:)` so output reaches the file.
- Do NOT use `privacy:` annotations in `MeridianLog` call sites (they are `os.Logger`-specific syntax and will cause a compile error).
- `LogFileWriter` is a `final class: @unchecked Sendable` — all writes are serialized on its `DispatchQueue`. It is safe to call from any thread, actor, or `Task`.
- Log files are not uploaded or transmitted anywhere. They are purely local diagnostic files in Application Support.
